@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/files/
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "配置文件存储器" as STORE
database "文件元数据 + ACL 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact file scope" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: POST JSON 或 multipart
API -> STORE: 保存字节 + 相关元数据 (multipart)
API -> DB: BEGIN; 插入元数据 + ACL
API -> OUT: 添加 file.created
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201 JSON 超级数据
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
TASK -> WORKER: 拿起工作
WORKER -> EVENT: 插入已完成的 file.created
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: file.created
@enduml
